    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617370/extras/28cd3b0c13b417f69029a19a0e7b8312.poster.avif?t=1748515426\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617370/extras/28cd3b0c13b417f69029a19a0e7b8312.webm?t=1748515426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617370/extras/28cd3b0c13b417f69029a19a0e7b8312.mp4?t=1748515426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Unknown in Anomaly Runner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a member of the Anomalies Detection Team, your mission is to investigate and contain mysterious anomalies across various high-risk areas. Face bizarre and unpredictable phenomena, uncover the hidden truth behind the ARC organization, and fight to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617370/extras/076eb24e24f204c4a53db97026e832d4.poster.avif?t=1748515426\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617370/extras/076eb24e24f204c4a53db97026e832d4.webm?t=1748515426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617370/extras/076eb24e24f204c4a53db97026e832d4.mp4?t=1748515426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Immerse yourself in a unique sci-fi world filled with mystery and danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Explore <strong>80+ anomalies</strong> across <strong>five distinct anomaly areas</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Unravel the gripping story of the ARC and its dark secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Use your intelligence and keen observation skills to find a way out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the unknown and uncover the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617370/extras/28cd3b0c13b417f69029a19a0e7b8312.poster.avif?t=1748515426\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617370/extras/28cd3b0c13b417f69029a19a0e7b8312.webm?t=1748515426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617370/extras/28cd3b0c13b417f69029a19a0e7b8312.mp4?t=1748515426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Unknown in Anomaly Runner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a member of the Anomalies Detection Team, your mission is to investigate and contain mysterious anomalies across various high-risk areas. Face bizarre and unpredictable phenomena, uncover the hidden truth behind the ARC organization, and fight to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617370/extras/076eb24e24f204c4a53db97026e832d4.poster.avif?t=1748515426\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617370/extras/076eb24e24f204c4a53db97026e832d4.webm?t=1748515426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617370/extras/076eb24e24f204c4a53db97026e832d4.mp4?t=1748515426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Immerse yourself in a unique sci-fi world filled with mystery and danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Explore <strong>80+ anomalies</strong> across <strong>five distinct anomaly areas</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Unravel the gripping story of the ARC and its dark secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Use your intelligence and keen observation skills to find a way out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the unknown and uncover the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Observe your surroundings closely in the Anomaly Research Center (ARC) to memorize important details. Detect unsettling anomalies to escape the hazardous areas. Uncover the dark secrets of the ARC organization in this innovative sci-fi horror walking simulator.",
